msgid "If it is lost, the data cannot be recovered by anyone. The kernel and boot files stay on a small unencrypted boot partition."
msgstr "Kapag nawala ito, walang makakabawi sa data. Mananatili ang kernel at mga boot file sa isang maliit na hindi naka-encrypt na boot partition."

